63
00:06:01,765 --> 00:06:02,405
[SPEAKER_04]: Oh, yeah, exactly.

64
00:06:02,465 --> 00:06:03,046
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, yeah.

65
00:06:03,166 --> 00:06:03,746
[SPEAKER_01]: One of those two.

66
00:06:03,846 --> 00:06:04,046
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

67
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:16,628
[SPEAKER_01]: So, of course, it's, for most people today, definitely, because of the starting point of being used to a lot of

68
