00:10:50,437 --> 00:11:06,188
[SPEAKER_01]: So, that's that authenticity factor and, you know, taking responsibility for your own mind and realizing that, you know, it's... the training is not... you're not doing it because the external code of being a monk, sort of, forces you to take it for

